te wish lists and collect money in a box\n• settle costs like dinners and weekend getaways\n• pay your bills (only in Norway)\n• tap to pay on card terminals (only in Norway)\n\nTo use Vipps you need BankID, a Norwegian/Swedish phone number, a Norwegian/Swedish bank card and account, as well as an email address. \n\nVipps is available in English, Norwegian (bokmål and nynorsk), Swedish, Danish and Finnish.\n\nMade in the Nordics, with love for making things very, very easy.","averageUserRating":4.73318,"bundleId":"no.dnb.vipps","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.73318,"sellerUrl":"https://www.vipps.no","languageCodesISO2A":["DA","EN","FI","KL","NB","NN","SV"],"fileSizeBytes":"177111040","formattedPrice":"Free","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":940736,"trackContentRating":"4+","trackName":"Vipps","trackId":984380185,"userRatingCount":940736}